  epo:usesTechnique <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/4fd6d98c-2ab7-4585-82a4-b212f12fddfb-01/AuctionTerms$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingProcess1_AuctionTerms1>,
